{
 "about": "[C6 3rd] The critic's finding 6: every thing in a stretch missed (run into, the right key pressed once stopped against it), each stretch started cold (the street run on through the market to the car: its things are at its end, and the market ends at his car, whose clock is the last word): in every stretch the warning comes; where there are four or five things, he is lost. tools/lib/c6_chase.mjs 'good' with missAll. NOIR_PORT=5346 node tools/play.mjs tools/plays/watcher_missall.json",
 "url": "/?mute=1&start=watcher.alley",
 "size": [
  1280,
  800
 ],
